{
  "slug": "mergify",
  "name": "Mergify",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for the Mergify CLI: manage merge queues, stacked pull requests, Test Insights (flaky tests, quarantine), merge protections, and Mergify configuration directly from the terminal.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `mergify-ci` (Use Mergify CI commands to upload JUnit test results, detect git references, manage CI scopes, and retrieve merge…), `mergify-config` (Use Mergify config commands to validate configuration files, simulate Mergify actions, and write Mergify configuration), `mergify-events` (Use `mergify events` to browse the Mergify activity log — every event Mergify recorded for a repository or…), `mergify-merge-protections` (Use Mergify merge protections to control when PRs merge — PR dependencies (Depends-On header), delayed merges (Merge-After header),…), `mergify-merge-queue` (Use Mergify merge queue to queue/dequeue PRs, to monitor and inspect the queue, and to diagnose a dequeued…), `mergify-stack` (Use Mergify stacks for git push, commit, branch, and PR creation)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mergify@claude-plugins-official` from `mergifyio/mergify-cli`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
